==Description==
'''v1.53.0''' is the one hundred and sixth update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 12th of February 2025. It introduced the [[Lovestruck Crate]].

This version contains nine update , the main v1.53.0 update (released 12 February 2025) and eight minor updates, the v1.53.1 (released 12 February 2025), v1.53.2 (released 12 February 2025), v1.53.3 (released 12 February 2025), v1.53.3a (released 12 February 2025), v1.53.3b (released 12 February 2025), v1.53.4 (released 12 February 2025), v1.53.4a (released 12 February 2025), v1.53.5 (released 13 February 2025) and v1.53.6 (released 18 February 2025).

