==Changes & Bugfixes==
===Towers===
*[[Executioner]] is now available through a gamepass and giftable for {{Robux|799}}.
*[[Snowballer]] and [[Elementalist]] gamepasses taken offsale.
*[[Gatling Gun]], [[Mercenary Base]], [[Crook Boss]], [[Turret]], [[Mortar]], [[Pursuit]], [[Warden]] and [[Cowboy]] can now be gifted.
*Increased {{Color|Other|Game Master}} [[Crook Boss]] piggy bank damage requirements.
**Level 0 increased from 250 to 530.
**Level 1 increased from 285 to 750.
**Level 2 increased from 323 to 850.
**Level 3 increased from 571 to 1,500.
**Level 4 increased from 1,142 to 3,000.
*Fixed {{Color|Toy|Toy}} [[Rocketeer]]'s Level 0–2 platform falling into the void.
*Fixed Level 3 {{Color|LunarYear|Lunar}} [[Hallow Punk]] having an incorrectly rotated weapon latch.

:In '''v1.53.2''':
*Fixed tower gifting.
*Fixed [[Jester]] being giftable, even though it is not on sale.

:In '''v1.53.3''':
*Fixed {{Color|Ducky|Ducky}} [[Mortar]] Level 0-3 hat being present at Level 4-5.
*Fixed {{Color|Toy|Toy}} [[Rocketeer]]'s Level 0-2 platform not disappearing at Level 3-4.
*Fixed {{Color|Krampus|Legend}} [[Accelerator]] beam not coming out of the dragon's mouth.
*Fixed {{Color|OperationICE|Frost Legion}} [[Grenadier]] having a visible blue box on its torso.
*Fixed {{Color|Pirate|Pirate}} [[Warden]] having an invisible shirt and torso at Level 4.

:In '''v1.53.4''':
*Fixed [[Executioner]] breaking after throwing its axe.

:In '''v1.53.6''':
*[[Executioner]] gamepass taken offsale.

===Enemies===
*Legacy enemies now use their statistics in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode, with the exception of these enemies:
**[[Frost Mystery (Frost Invasion)]]
**[[Frost Necromancer (Frost Invasion)]]
**[[Frost Spirit (Frost Invasion)]]
*Fixed [[Mystery Boss]] summoning nothing on death.
*Indirectly fixed legacy [[Deep Freeze (Frost Invasion)|Deep Freeze]], legacy [[Frozen (Frost Invasion)|Frozen]], legacy [[Packed Ice (Frost Invasion)|Packed Ice]] and legacy [[Snowman (Cold Ambush)|Snowman]] not having default health values, making them break in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode by making them use their actual statistics.
*Fixed [[Fallen Titan]] ''Smash'' ability shockwave not appearing.
*Fixed legacy [[Fallen Rusher (Legacy)|Fallen Rusher]] having broken animations in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode.
*Fixed legacy [[Fallen Guardian (Legacy)|Fallen Guardian]] having broken ability animations in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode.
*Fixed legacy [[Fallen Soul (Legacy)|Fallen Soul]] having broken ability animations in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode.
*Fixed legacy [[Grave Digger (Legacy)|Grave Digger]] having broken ability animations in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode.
*Fixed legacy [[Frost Hero (Frost Invasion)|Frost Hero]] not using its abilities in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode.

:In '''v1.53.3a''':
*[[Gold Guard]] now solidifies towers when hitting them.
*[[Gold Titan]] changed.
**''Golden Summoning'' summon count decreased from 5-8 to 3-5.
**''Golden Summoning'' no longer summons [[Golden]]s.
*[[Creator]] no longer summons [[Developer 1]], [[Developer 2]] and [[Developer 3]].
*Fixed [[Gold Titan]] now using any of its abilities, though ''Midas' Slash'' still does not work.
*Fixed [[Creator]] ''Stomp'' ability animation not working.
*Fixed [[SCT]] not stunning towers.
*Fixed [[Mechanical Rot (Legacy)|Mechanical Rot]] not stunning towers.

===Crates===
*[[Lunar Crate]] taken offsale.

:In '''v1.53.4''':
*Added two skins to the [[Lovestruck Crate]].
**Skins:
***[[Ranger]]: {{Color|Lovestruck|Valentines}}
***[[Electroshocker]]: {{Color|Lovestruck|Valentines}}

===Miscellaneous===
*Added the ability to apply detections to towers in [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] stat editor.
*Decreased [[Fallen Mode|Fallen]] health scaling.
**Duo health scaling removed.
**Decreased from 20% to 10% in trio.
**Decreased from 30% to 20% in quad.
*Removed duo health scaling for [[Molten Mode|Molten]] mode.
*Quickdraw time requirement decreased from 18 to 16 minutes.
*{{ReviveTicket|Revive Tickets}} changed, now they revert the state of the game to be exactly like it was on the wave instead of selling everything.
*Disabled {{ReviveTicket|Revive Tickets}} for [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode, [[Badlands II]] and [[Polluted Wasteland II]].
*Disabled tower interactions when [[Time Scale]] is set to anything lower than 0.0005x.
*Updated loading screen.
*Increased max [[Party]] size from four to six.
*Replaced [[Operation I.C.E Event#Operation I.C.E Battle Pass|Operation I.C.E Battle Pass]] banner with the banner leading to the [[Lovestruck Crate]] exclusive [[Mission Quests]].
*Extended [[Pizza Party]] wave timers.
*Fixed [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] stat editor statistics not being applied to already placed towers above Level 1, only being applied visually to the stat box.
*Fixed [[Login Rewards]] not appearing upon joining.
*Fixed consumables being visible only to the player that used them.
*Fixed [[Robux Shop]] having multiple unreleased towers listed as being on sale.

:In '''v1.53.1''':
*Fixed starting regular [[Mission Quests]] starting a [[Lovestruck Crate]] skin [[Mission Quests|Mission Quest]] instead.
*Fixed [[Mission Quests]] softlocking players who got a nan value for damage requirements.

:In '''v1.53.2''':
*Fixed revives making towers cost float.

:In '''v1.53.3a''':
*Added [[Legacy Molten Mode|Legacy Molten]], [[Golden Mode|Golden]], [[Legacy Fallen Mode|Legacy Fallen]] and legacy [[Hidden Wave (Legacy)|Hidden Wave]] modes to [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode.
**All naturally spawning enemies in these modes now can also be summoned.

:In '''v1.53.3b''':
*Removed legacy [[Hidden Wave (Legacy)|Hidden Wave]] mode from [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode.

:In '''v1.53.4''':
*Fixed [[Firework Technician]] [[Mission Quests|Mission Quest]] being unclaimable by claiming it for every single player who has it active.

:In '''v1.53.4a''':
*''Heartbreaker'' and ''Heart Smasher'' third objective now requires [[Fallen Mode|Fallen]] mode triumphs instead of [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] mode.
*Fixed revive tickets allowing players to bypass placement limits.

:In '''v1.53.5''':
*Fixed ''Love Launcher'' [[Mission Quests|Mission Quest]] first objective not tracking the number of missiles fired correctly.
*Fixed ''Love Launcher'' [[Mission Quests|Mission Quest]] first objective incorrectly listing the required missiles as 300 instead of 600 in the description.
*Fixed revive tickets incorrectly reverting tower placement limits.
*Fixed [[Matchmaking]] screen locking [[Sandbox Mode|Sandbox]] mode player number options due to players being under {{Level|250}}, even when the player is {{Level|250+}}.

:In '''v1.53.6''':
*Fixed '''Romantic Reaper''', '''Love Launcher''', '''Joker of Hearts''' and '''Heart Smasher''' [[Mission Quests|Mission]] incorrect timer.

